{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":201,"count":25,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L03-2-04\",\"铅笔\",\"鉛筆\",\"铅笔\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"A：你要哪種筆？ B：我要鉛筆。","pinyin":"A: Nǐ yào nǎ zhǒng bǐ? B: Wǒ yào qiānbǐ.","english":"A: What kind of pen do you want? B: I want a pencil.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-04","sourceFront":"鉛筆","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我有兩枝鉛筆。","pinyin":"Wǒ yǒu liǎng zhī qiānbǐ.","english":"I have two pencils.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-08","sourceFront":"枝","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這種小鉛筆怎麼樣？","pinyin":"Zhè zhǒng xiǎo qiānbǐ zěnmeyàng?","english":"What do you think about this type of small pencil?","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-01","sourceFront":"這","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L13-3-08\",\"第\",\"第\",\"第\",\"Det\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我們下個星期要學第十五課，我剛才先看了一點兒，書上有很多種動物，我覺得很有意思。","pinyin":"Wǒmen xià ge xīngqí yào xué dì shíwǔ kè, wǒ gāngcái xiān kàn le yìdiǎnr, shū shàng yǒu hěn duō zhǒng dòngwù, wǒ juéde hěn yǒuyìsi.","english":"We are going to learn lesson fifteen next week. I previewed a bit earlier just now. There are many kinds of animals in the book; I think it is very interesting.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"a 竹(bamboo) flute pokes a 弔(string of 100 cash) to tally each 第(ordinal)."},{"key":"[\"B2L07-2-24\",\"機票\",\"機票\",\"机票\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"從下個月起，飛機票就變貴了。","pinyin":"Cóng xià gè yuè qǐ, fēijī piào jiù biàn guì le.","english":"Starting from next month, plane tickets will become more expensive.","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-18","sourceFront":"起","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"張老闆開會開得太久，沒趕上飛機，只好花錢再買一張機票了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-09","sourceFront":"趕上","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我請旅行社代訂從