"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"美美剛進模特兒公司時，有一位導演找她演戲，沒想到就讓她變成了有名的明星。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-12","sourceFront":"進","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這幾天電視上一連播了好幾部同一位導演拍的電影，一部比一部好看。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-28","sourceFront":"播","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個女演員演戲的樣子很自然，一點也不誇張，難怪導演很欣賞她。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-12","sourceFront":"自然","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"李導演付出了十年的時間，終於拍出了一部好電影，得到大家的肯定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-18","sourceFront":"付出","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那部電影沒有結局，是導演要留給觀眾想像的空間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-32","sourceFront":"結局","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位演員有劇場表演的經驗，所以導演決定用他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-03","sourceFront":"劇場","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在指導演員的表達方式上，這位導演的經驗相當豐富。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-10","sourceFront":"指導","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想導演一部以蟲子當作主角的電影，真不是件容易的事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-05","sourceFront":"導演","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 導(direct) and 演(perform): 導演 means director."},{"key":"[\"B3L03-1-34\",\"购买\",\"購買\",\"购买\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"想要吸引顧客來購買價格高的商品，除了品質好，服務態度也很重要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-34","sourceFront":"購買","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這本書有豐富的內容及生動的鉛筆畫，是吸引讀者購買的主要原因。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-07","sourceFront":"及","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在這家網路書店購買商品，顧客得先匯款。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourc