in":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-29","sourceFront":"拒絕","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我住的地方很偏僻，手機常收不到訊息，朋友很難跟我聯絡。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-32","sourceFront":"訊息","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在國外遇見好久沒聯絡的好友，是一件很開心的事情。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-13","sourceFront":"遇見","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你想參加這項長跑比賽的話，可以到網站報名，登記之後會有人跟你聯絡。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-02","sourceFront":"登記","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L11-2-18\",\"冷淡\",\"冷淡\",\"冷淡\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他最近對你說話的態度變得冷淡，你們之間是不是有什麼誤會？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-18","sourceFront":"冷淡","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A:要是你發現男朋友對你越來越冷淡，還常跟女網友約會， 你會原諒他嗎？ B:這麼花心的男人，絕對不值得原諒。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-23","sourceFront":"原諒","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 冷(cold) and 淡(light): 冷淡 means cold, frigid."},{"key":"[\"B3L16-2-19\",\"觀點\",\"觀點\",\"观点\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"到底上帝存在不存在，科學與宗教的觀點不同，說法也不一樣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-19","sourceFront":"觀點","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我雖然尊敬他，卻不認同他所堅持的觀點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-18","sourceFront":"認同","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這件事大家都堅持自己的觀點，討論不出結果，還是找個說話有分量的人來決定吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-42","sourceFront":"分量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Viewing 觀(observe) scenery at this designated 點(point): 觀點 means viewpoint."},{"key":"[\"B4L04-1-36\",\"中式\",\"中式\",\"中式\",\"Vs-attr\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我爺爺習慣吃中式早餐，每天早上都是吃包子配豆漿。","p